00:11:59.868 --> 00:12:00.428
<v Barbara Trachte>Oui

135
00:12:00.438 --> 00:12:01.408
<v Guillaume Hachez>...très majoritairement des hommes.

136
00:12:01.468 --> 00:12:11.088
